   "text": "Yeah, it sounded like it was coming from underneath.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.36,
   "block": "cars.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I think it might be the exhaust again.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 2.33,
   "block": "cars.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "My brother had the same thing. It was just a loose heat shield.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 1.26,
   "block": "cars.side1"
  },
  {
